{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASH AND DIE</strong> is a first-person horror game where you take photos of houses for a real estate agency. They\u2019ve decided to try something new and unusual \u2013 night shots of their listings.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>PHOTOGRAPH THE PROPERTY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to capture the rooms on your checklist and get the perfect shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/74b83c089e8f2bb23d28662a21a9a5b3.poster.avif?t=1762248022\" width=1046 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/74b83c089e8f2bb23d28662a21a9a5b3.webm?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/74b83c089e8f2bb23d28662a21a9a5b3.mp4?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>EXPLORE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through dark hallways and rooms to find the best angles for your photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/8b16c851f5f0a3a0f8d3f57bb9761f4b.poster.avif?t=1762248022\" width=1046 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/8b16c851f5f0a3a0f8d3f57bb9761f4b.webm?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/8b16c851f5f0a3a0f8d3f57bb9761f4b.mp4?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>STAY ALIVE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is still inside. Avoid it, hide, or run before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/01f6fa10149b18ddbd9ca8dcc0c6efc3.poster.avif?t=1762248022\" width=1046 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/01f6fa10149b18ddbd9ca8dcc0c6efc3.webm?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/01f6fa10149b18ddbd9ca8dcc0c6efc3.mp4?t=1762248022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to snap night-time photos of each property while navigating dark, eerie rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every door is open. Explore what\u2019s accessible, but be ready for the unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the perfect shot while staying alive. Every click could put you in danger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in tense, atmospheric environments with unpredictable threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/c740ccf0c62ee5e8d2caa6c30fece619.avif?t=1762248022\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985060?t=1762248022","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985060?t=1762248022","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/b7134db34df6cc99fd529a9a0790ed2aeac75928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762248022","capsule_image